  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholders have increased income and access to markets. Providing the necessary knowledge to the target group on how to increase their productivity in a sustainable way; diversifying smallholders&#x2019; sources of income; supporting seed multiplication and selection; training and promoting sustainable environmental practices and climate-smart agriculture; strengthening farmer&#x2019;s groups /associations/cooperatives; entrepreneurial skills training; linking farmers to more profitable markets and driving value-addition; developing community-based early warning and response systems for climate resilience. Participants are vulnerable rural smallholder households (men and women), with a special focus on women, youth and people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
